# DarkWow Docker build context
#
# The Dockerfile clones source from origin at build time (git clone).
# Local files are never COPY'd — the build context exists only to
# provide the Dockerfile and entrypoint scripts.
#
# Exclude everything by default...
*
# ...then whitelist only what the build actually uses
!contrib/docker/darkwow-testnet/entrypoint.sh
!contrib/docker/darkwow-testnet/entrypoint-monero.sh
!contrib/docker/darkwow-testnet/entrypoint-p2pool.sh
